--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Attribution and interoperability
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project is an independent reimplementation of a mod launcher for
XCOM 2: War of the Chosen on Linux. It does not contain source code, binaries,
artwork, icons, translations, or other assets from the Alternative Mod Launcher
(AML).

AML is a separate project by the X2CommunityCore contributors, licensed under
GPL-3.0:
  https://github.com/X2CommunityCore/xcom2-launcher

AML's file formats and observable behavior were used for interoperability:
  - reading AML's settings.json;
  - reading and writing XCOM 2's XComModOptions.ini;
  - reproducing AML-compatible conflict and dependency checks;
  - reading mod ReadMe/Config files.

No game files, Workshop mods, Steam content, or third-party launcher assets are
distributed with this project. See `PROVENANCE.md` for the audit notes.

